            D  1| 1.0000000E+00
            D  1| 0.0000000E+00
            D  1| 0.0000000E+00
            D  1| 0.0000000E+00
            D  1| 0.0000000E+00
            C 79| f(k) = fac/ (1 + ( tnat*k )**expom)
                |
